    "shot_note": "No RISC-V C compiler on this machine, so examples/ELF/RanPi-RV32 (precompiled C) is run instead of matrixmul.c. The ~120000-cycle run is longer than \"Max. cache plot cycles\" (default 10000), so the plot shows the most recent cycles with the note above it."
  },
